[32m+[m[32m# AI-Based SOC with Automated Firewall Response[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Project Overview[m
[32m+[m[32mAI-Based SOC with Automated Firewall Response is a Security Operations Center platform that detects, analyzes, and automates responses to network attacks in real-time. The system combines attack detection, threat analysis using AI/ML, risk scoring, MITRE ATT&CK mapping, and automated firewall actions to provide comprehensive security monitoring and response capabilities.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Problem Statement[m
[32m+[m[32mModern SOC teams face challenges in real-time attack detection, analysis, and automated response. Manual processes are slow, inconsistent, and prone to error. There is a need for an integrated system that can automatically detect attacks, assess risk, provide AI-powered threat analysis, and take automated mitigation actions while maintaining visibility across all attack vectors.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Objectives[m
[32m+[m[32m- Real-time attack detection and monitoring[m
[32m+[m[32m- AI-powered threat analysis and risk scoring[m
[32m+[m[32m- Automated firewall response based on confirmed threats[m
[32m+[m[32m- Visual attack mapping and dashboard analytics[m
[32m+[m[32m- MITRE ATT&CK classification for attack categorization[m
[32m+[m[32m- WebSocket-powered real-time updates[m
[32m+[m[32m- Private IP address safety handling[m
[32m+[m[32m- Comprehensive KPI tracking and reporting[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Key Features[m
[32m+[m[32m### Live Attack Map[m
[32m+[m[32m- Real-time attack visualization using react-simple-maps[m
