[32m+[m[32m- No fake coordinates or fabricated geographic data[m
[32m+[m[32m- Updates on WebSocket new_attack events[m
[32m+[m[32m- Geographic info from backend threat intelligence[m
[32m+[m[32m### AI Threat Analysis[m
[32m+[m[32m- Loading ("Analyzing threat..."), error ("Threat analysis unavailable"), and empty ("No attack selected") states[m
[32m+[m[32m- Real backend data: attack type, severity, risk score, source IP, analysis, recommended response, confidence[m
[32m+[m[32m- No fake AI text or hardcoded responses[m
[32m+[m[32m- Safe handling of null, empty, and malformed responses[m
