[32m+[m[32m- Confirmed status display (Blocked/Allowed/Pending/Failed)[m
[32m+[m[32m- No false "blocked" claims (detection != mitigation)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Backend-integrated firewall API[m
[32m+[m[32m- IP validation before any action[m
[32m+[m[32m- Audit-ready rule management[m
