[32m+[m[32m- Total attacks, blocked IPs, active incidents, assets monitored, threat intel matches, automated responses[m
[32m+[m[32m- Real-time WebSocket updates[m
[32m+[m[32m- Polling fallback when WebSocket unavailable[m
[32m+[m[32m- Empty and error state handling[m
