[32m+[m[32m- Dynamic pie chart with real backend data[m
[32m+[m[32m- Attack type normalization (DoS, DOS, sql, SQL injection, etc.)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Percentage calculations with zero-value category support[m
[32m+[m[32m### Severity Distribution[m
[32m+[m[32m- critical, high, medium, low handling[m
[32m+[m[32m- Count + percentage display[m
[32m+[m[32m- Zero-value categories supported[m
[32m+[m[32m- Capitalization consistency[m
