[32m+[m[32m- Grouping by source_ip/src_ip/source[m
[32m+[m[32m- Event count, highest severity, common attack type[m
[32m+[m[32m- Average risk score, sorting, top 5 behavior[m
[32m+[m[32m- Missing IP graceful handling[m
[32m+[m[32m### Attack Feed[m
[32m+[m[32m- Real-time new attack notifications[m
[32m+[m[32m- Deduplication prevention[m
[32m+[m[32m- WebSocket and polling updates[m
