[32m+[m[32m- **GET /api/v1/attacks** - List attacks (limit parameter supported)[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Requires: admin or analyst role[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Parameters: `limit` (default: 100)[m
[32m+[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m- **POST /api/v1/attacks** - Create new attack record[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Requires: admin or analyst role[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Payload: source_ip, destination_ip, attack_type, severity, timestamp, raw_message, status_code, payload[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Firewall[m
[32m+[m[32m- **POST /api/v1/firewall/block** - Block IP address[m
