[32m+[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m- **POST /api/v1/firewall/unblock** - Unblock IP address[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Requires: admin or analyst role[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Payload: ip_address, reason[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Threat Intelligence[m
[32m+[m[32m- **GET /api/v1/threat-intel/check?ip=X.X.X.X** - Check IP reputation[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Requires: admin or analyst role[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Parameters: ip (required)[m
[32m+[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m- **GET /api/v1/geo/lookup?ip=X.X.X.X** - Geo IP lookup[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Requires: admin or analyst role[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Parameters: ip (required)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### WebSocket[m
[32m+[m[32m- **ws://127.0.0.1:8001/ws/attacks** - Real-time attack events[m
