[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Health[m
[32m+[m[32m- **GET /health** - Backend health check (public endpoint)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Hunting/ML[m
[32m+[m[32m- **POST /api/v1/hunting/search** - Hunt attacks by criteria[m
